"><span lang=\"en-in\" class=\"auto-style8\"><strong>Others:</strong> <span>This disease attack can \ncauses reduction in photosynthetic activity and defoliation of leaves thereby \nreducing the vitality of the host plant.</span></span></p>\n</article><!--cutoutright-->\n<!--END OF CUTOUT BOX-->\n\n<!--a sub heading and some content-->\n<h3 class=\"auto-style7\"><span lang=\"en-in\">Fungal Diseases -<span class=\"auto-style13\"> \nStem end rot</span></span></h3>\n\t\t<div class=\"auto-style5\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"auto-style10\"><em><strong>Botryodiplodia theobromae</strong></em></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"auto-style5\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"auto-style10\"><strong>The fungus also causes die-back \n\t\t\tsymptoms</strong></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t<p class=\"auto-style10\"><span><strong>Recorded in all mango growing \n\t\t\tareas in India</strong></span></p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<p class=\"auto-style7\">&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t<h4 class=\"auto-style2\">Stem end rot infection on mango</h4>\n<ul class=\"images-enlarge\" style=\"height: 195px; width: 525px;\"> <!-- Images enlarge on hover, see   for an explanation-->\n<li><a href=\"anthra1/stemrot1a.jpg\">\n<img src=\"anthra1/stemrot1as.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"101\" alt=\"STem end rot(thumbnail)\"></a><a><span><img src=\"anthra1/stemrot1a.jpg\" alt=\" Disease (larger image)\" width=\"500\" height=\"338\">\n<button id=\"tabbed1\" class=\"bordered\">Symptoms and control !</button>\n<br><strong>Stem end rot</strong> It attacks the fruits. Dark epicarp is seen around the base of the pedicel at first. Affected area enlarges to form a circular, black patch.</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"auto-style1\" style=\"left: 1px; top: 0px; width: 292px; height: 133px\">\n<a href=\"anthra1/stemrot2a.jpg\">\n<img src=\"anthra1/stemrot2as.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"98\" alt=\"Stem end rot (thumbnail)\" style=\"float: right\"></a><a><span><img src=\"anthra1/stemrot2a.jpg\" alt=\" Disease (larger image)\" width=\"500\" height=\"326\">\n<button id=\"tabbed1\" class=\"bordered\">Symptoms and control !</button>\n<br><strong>Stem end rot</strong> It attacks the fruits. Epicarp turns dark around the base of the pedicel in the initial stage. Subsequently the affected area enlarges to form a circular black patch which extends rapidly under humid atmosphere and turns the whole fruit completely black within two or three days  </span></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<ul class=\"images-enlarge\" style=\"height: 195px; width: 525px;\"> <!-- Images enlarge on hover, see   for an explanation-->\n<li><a href=\"anthra1/stemendrot3.jpg\">\n<img src=\"anthra1/stemendrot3s.jpg\" width=\"150\" height=\"105\" alt=\"STem end rot(thumbnail)\"></a><a><span><img src=\"anthra1/stemendrot3.jpg\" alt=\" Disease (larger image)\" width=\"500\" height=\"349\">\n<button id=\"tabbed1\" class=\"bordered\">Symptoms and control !</button>\n\n<br><strong>Stem end rot</strong> The whole fruit turns black with in 3-4 days under humid environment</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"auto-style1\" style=\"left: 1px; top: 0px; width: 292px; height: 133px\">\n<a href=\"anthra1/stemendrot4.jpg\">\n<img src=\"anthra1/stemendrot4s.jpg\" width=\"170\" height=\"101\" alt=\"Stem end rot (thumbnail)\" style=\"float: right\"></a><a><span><img src=\"anthra1/stemendrot4.jpg\" alt=\" Disease (larger image)\" width=\"500\" height=\"266\">\n<button id=\"tabbed1\" class=\"bordered\">Symptoms and control !</button>\n<br><strong>Stem end rot</strong> The pulp of the diseased fruits becomes brown and somewhat soft. </span></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"small\">(<span lang=\"en-in\"> Move mouse </span>over a thumbnail for a full sized version)</p>\n\t\t<p class=\"small\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"auto-style4\" style=\"width: 645px\"><span class=\"auto-style5\"><strong>\nStem end rot :</strong> <span>It attacks the fruits. Epicarp turns dark around \nthe base of the pedicel in the initial stage. Subsequently the affected area \nenlarges to form a circular black patch which extends rapidly under humid \natmosphere and turns the whole fruit completely black within two or three days. \nThe pulp of the diseased fruits becomes brown and somewhat soft. Careful \nharvesting and subsequent handling of the fruits to avoid any injury is very \nimportant. </span></span> </p>\n\t\t<p class=\"auto-style4\" style=\"width: 637px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<!--and another sub heading and related content-->\n\n</div><!---content-->\n<!--END OF MAIN CONTENT-->\n\n<!--FOOTER (usuaully contains additional site info and navigation-->\n<footer>\n<!--FOOTER NAVIGATION (substitute # with your page link)-->\n<nav>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../index.html\">Home </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../Technologies.html\">Technologies</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../var/varieties.html\">Varieties </a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#\" title=\"\">Crop production</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../cropprotect.html\">Crop Protection</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../cropimprove.html\">Crop improvement</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../Technologies/machineries.html\">Machineries</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../ContactUs.html\">Contact us</a></li>\n<li><a>Pest management</a></li>\n</ul>\n</nav><!--end nav-->\n<!--END OF FOOTER NAVIGATION-->\n<!--SEARCH BOX-->\n<section id=\"footer-search\">\n<!--add your own search form here-->\n<form>\n<input id=\"term\" value=\"search the site\" onfocus=\"this.value='';\" onblur=\"if (this.value=='') {this.value='';}\"> <!--the content of value will appear in the search box until the box comes into focus-->\n<input id=\"searchbutton\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Search\">\n</form>\n</section><!--end footer-search-->\n<!--END OF SEARCH BOX-->\n</footer>\n<!--END OF FOOTER-->\n\n</div><!--end wrapper-->\n\n<!--BASE-->\n<section id=\"base\"><!--PLEASE LEAVE THIS TAG IN PLACE - by all means change the font size and/or the colours if you want it to blend in more (or even hide it), as long as it's visible in the source code-->\n\t<a href=\"http://www.w3.org/html/logo/#the-logo\" target=\"_blank\">\n&nbsp;</a><span class=